<title>AUSTRIA: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP FIRST LEG SLALOM TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP FIRST LEG SLALOM TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>SEMMERING, Austria 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first leg</p>
<p>times in a women's Alpine skiing World Cup slalom on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden) 51.18 seconds</p>
<p>2. Anita Wachter (Austria) 51.61</p>
<p>3. Claudia Riegler (New Zealand) 51.69</p>
<p>4. Sonja Nef (Switzerland) 51.85</p>
<p>5. Ylva Nowen (Sweden) 51.90</p>
<p>6. Deborah Compagnoni (Italy) 51.92</p>
<p>7. Elfi Eder (Austria) 52.00</p>
<p>8. Gabriela Zingre-Graf (Switzerland) 52.01</p>
<p>9. Lara Magoni (Italy) 52.10</p>
<p>10. Patricia Chauvet (France) 52.23</p>
</text>
